        "startIndex": 582,
        "endIndex": 764,
        "text": "#### Candidate [0] & [16]: Meta Unveils Meta VR Glasses and Camera-Less Audio Smart Glasses\n* **Confirmed:** At Meta Connect 2026 on September 23, Meta announced its hardware roadmap"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0,
        1,
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 798,
        "endIndex": 1027,
        "text": "**Meta VR Glasses:** A 100-gram headset featuring dual 5K micro-OLED displays, eye tracking, and hand tracking, tethered via fiber-optic cable to a 300g pocket compute puck powered by Qualcomm's Snapdragon Reality Elite processor"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        3,
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1029,
        "endIndex": 1076,
        "text": "Scheduled to ship in Spring 2027 for $1,299 USD"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        3,
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1083,
        "endIndex": 1231,
        "text": "**Ray-Ban Meta Audio:** A camera-free pair of AI smart glasses weighing 43g with 12-hour battery life, priced at $349 and launching October 13, 2026"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        5,
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1233,
        "endIndex": 1331,
        "text": "Designed explicitly to address privacy concerns and public pushback against covert video recording"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        5,
        2,
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1333,
        "endIndex": 1427,
        "text": "* **Important Caveats:** Meta VR Glasses are a pre-release announcement (shipping Spring 2027)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        3,
        4
